# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Westly Demo Hotel — Cloudflare Pages headers
#
# Ported from the retired netlify.toml [[headers]] blocks. See DEPLOYMENT.md
# for the decision record and the verification notes below.
#
# connect-src note: https://westlyhotel.investorwestly.workers.dev is kept
# because src/lib/notifications.ts fetches it directly from the browser (it
# is a Telegram/push notification relay Worker, NOT the housekeeping-cron
# Worker — the housekeeping-cron Worker is never called from client code,
# see DEPLOYMENT.md § "Worker connect-src verification").
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-XSS-Protection: 1; mode=block
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://*.firebaseio.com https://*.googleapis.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://*.firebaseio.com https://*.googleapis.com https://westlyhotel.investorwestly.workers.dev https://*.supabase.co wss://*.firebaseio.com wss://*.supabase.co; frame-ancestors 'none';

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/admin-sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/admin-manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
